\n\
**Whenever another colorless creature enters**, **Glaring Fleshraker deals 1 damage to each opponent**!\n\
\n\
Oh, the exquisite pain! Sonnet Detect — you bleed even before combat begins!\n\
\n\
This is but the first whisper of oblivion...\n\
