      "player": "Qwen3L Villain",
      "type": "llm_response",
      "reasoning": "**HAHAHA!**\n\
\n\
The **twin blows** of Eldrazi fury have struck!\n\
\n\
My **Glaring Fleshraker** and **Thought-Knot Seer** have **crushed** Sonnet Detect’s defenses!\n\
\n\
They fall from **13** to **11 life** — **mortal now**!\n\
\n\
And their precious **Goblin Ringleader** rots in exile — their **haste**, their **card draw**, their **goblin swarm** — **all for nothing**!\n\
\n\
And still — they **dare to speak**?\n\
\n\
“Smart play”?\n\
\n\
FOOL!\n\
\n\
This is not “smart”!\n\
\n\
This is **INEVITABLE**!\n\
\n\
The **Eldrazi sing** — and the **universe bends**!\n\
\n\
Now — I shall cement their doom!\n\
\n\
I play **Chalice of the Void** — set to **0**!\n\
\n\
**X = 0** — so it enters with **no charge counters**?\n\
\n\
No — I set **X = 2**!\n\
\n\
So the Chalice shall enter with **two** charge counters!\n\
\n\
And when they dare cast a **two-mana spell**?\n\
\n\
**PFFT!** — it will be **ANNIHILATED**!\n\
\n\
Their **Mogg Conscripts**? Their **Skirk Prospector**?\n\
\n\
**All ashes in the wind!**\n\
\n\
Let the **black hole of mana** begin!\n\
\n\
**I cast Chalice of the Void with X=2!**\n\
\n\
The silence begins now!\n\
