      "type": "llm_response",
      "reasoning": "**AHAHAHA!**\n\
\n\
Sonnet Detect — you **mock** my **Chalice of the Void**?\n\
\n\
You think I set it to **zero**?\n\
\n\
**Fool**! I set it to **TWO**!\n\
\n\
And what is your **Cavern of Souls**?\n\
\n\
Is it a **zero-mana spell**?\n\
\n\
**No**!\n\
\n\
You play it at **one mana**!\n\
\n\
And your **Goblin Ringleader**?\n\
\n\
**Exiled** by **Thought-Knot Seer**!\n\
\n\
You have **no one**!\n\
\n\
No **free plays**, no **escape**!\n\
\n\
And now — the new dawn rises!\n\
\n\
I play **Abundant Countryside** — another **Eldrazi engine**!\n\
\n\
And now — I cast **Eldrazi Linebreaker** — **{1}{C}{R}** — a **3/3 trampler** with a gift!\n\
\n\
At **the beginning of combat**, it grants **haste and +X/+0**, where **X** is the number of Eldrazi I control!\n\
\n\
**FIVE**! I have **FIVE** Eldrazi!\n\
\n\
Soon — **SIX**!\n\
\n\
And it has **trample** — so when it crashes through, your **life** spills like **goblin blood**!\n\
\n\
**Linebreaker**, I play you!\n\
\n\
And after — **Kozilek’s Command**! One copy — I cast it!\n\
\n\
**X = 2** — I choose:\n\
\n\
- **Exile target creature with mana value 2 or less**\n\
- And — **draw a card**\n\
\n\
Yes — exile your **Mogg Conscripts** — the last of your goblin might — and then **I draw**\n\
\n\
You are **nothing**!\n\
\n\
And your **life**?\n\
\n\
You are at **10** — I am at **18**.\n\
\n\
Next turn — I **attack** — **Thought-Knot Seer**, **Glaring Fleshraker**, **Eldrazi Linebreaker** — **9 damage**!\n\
\n\
You fall to **1** — then I finish you!\n\
\n\
And the **Chalice**? It is **set to two** — so your **one-mana goblin spells** — still **uninterrupted**!\n\
\n\
But — does it matter?\n\
\n\
You have no board — no threats — no **hope**!\n\
\n\
**I cast Eldrazi Linebreaker!**\n\
\n\
Your fate is **sealed**!\n\
