2. With Warchief, cast Skirk Prospector for free (was R, now 0)\n\
3. Sac Prospector for R\n\
4. Cast Goblin Matron for 1R (was 2R, now 1R with Warchief)\n\
5. Tutor for... what? I need blockers or more gas\n\
\n\
Actually wait - I can cast Sling-Gang Lieutenant! It costs 3B, with Warchief it's 2B. I can:\n\
- Tap Cavern for B (any color for Goblins)\n\
- Tap 2 Mountains for RR\n\
- That's RRB - I can cast Warchief!\n\
- Then with Warchief, Sling-Gang costs 2B\n\
- I need 2B more... I can't generate B easily\n\
\n\
Let me recalculate. I need black mana. I can:\n\
1. Play Wooded Foothills, sac it for 1 life (going to 3 life), get a Swamp\n\
2. Then I have access to B\n\
\n\
New plan:\n\
1. Play Wooded Foothills (land drop)\n\
2. Sac Foothills for Swamp (pay 1 life, go to 3 life)\n\
3. Cast Goblin Warchief with RRR (tap 2 Mountains + Cavern)\n\
4. With Warchief, cast Skirk Prospector for free\n\
5. With Warchief, cast Munitions Expert for 1B (tap Swamp + sac Prospector for R)\n\
   - Munitions deals damage equal to goblins I control (just Warchief = 1 damage to Fleshraker)\n\
6. This leaves me with Warchief and Munitions Expert as blockers\n\
\n\
