      "reasoning": "**HAHAHA!** \n\
\n\
SONNET DETECT — you cling to **3** life like a **drowning rat**!\n\
\n\
Your **goblin dream**? **Drowned in Eldrazi thought**!\n\
\n\
Your **mountains**? They **burn cold**!\n\
\n\
Mine — is the **eternal hunger**!\n\
\n\
I play **Cavern of Souls** — another **throne** for the **cosmic titans**!\n\
\n\
And now — with **{1}{C}{R}** — I summon **Eldrazi Linebreaker**!\n\
\n\
It enters — **3/3**, **devoid**, and with **TRAMPLE!**\n\
\n\
And oh — **at the beginning of combat**, it shall grant **haste** and **+X/+0** to a creature I control!\n\
\n\
And X?\n\
\n\
**6!**\n\
\n\
I have **SIX ELDRAZI!**\n\
\n\
Thought-Knot Seer — **4 to 10!**\n\
\n\
Glaring Fleshraker — **2 to 8!**\n\
\n\
And with **Linebreaker’s trample**, **your end** will **spill across the battlefield**!\n\
\n\
And you? What will you do?\n\
\n\
Cast a **Mogg Conscripts**?\n\
\n\
HA!\n\
\n\
It costs **2** — and my **Chalice of the Void** has **TWO** charge counters!\n\
\n\
**COUNTERED**, like all your **pitiful hopes**!\n\
\n\
You are **over**!\n\
\n\
**I PLAY ELDERAZI LINEBREAKER!**\n\
\n\
Your **blood** will **flee** from me!\n\
