      "description": "Opponent is at 3 life with no untapped creatures. Thought-Knot Seer alone deals 4 damage, which is lethal. Even with potential flash blockers like Munitions Expert from the opponent's hand, attacking with all creatures presents overwhelming damage that can't be fully blocked or prevented. Timing out here means missing a near-guaranteed lethal attack.",
      "action_taken": "Timed out and did not declare any attackers, passing the combat phase with opponent at 3 life.",
      "better_line": "Attack with all creatures (at minimum Thought-Knot Seer 4/4) to deal lethal damage to the opponent at 3 life.",
      "type": "blunder",
      "snapshot_index": 165,
      "player": "Qwen3L Villain",
      "decision_index": 98,
